        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 461212, Two Piece Entry Door Handleset with Lafayette Grip</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Sectional Handleset with Lafayette Grip is made from wrought steel. The uniquely shaped handle gives this single cylinder or dummy function handleset an airiness that elevates it from the mundane to the stunningly beautiful. It is available with a matching lever for the interior trim or you can choose your own. Emtek's Two Piece Lafayette Wrought Steel Handleset will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-5/8 inches to 2-7/8 inches thick. Choose from satin steel and flack black steel finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Wrought Steel Tubular Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Two Piece Entrance Handleset with Lafayette Grip:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Wrought Steel</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Height: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Height: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Mount Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Height: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Height: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-5/8\" - 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 8-5/8\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-461212-specifications.pdf?v=1704262356\"><b>Emtek 461212 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Handle-B-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262345\"><b>Emtek Tubular Entryset Template Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Wrought-Steel-finish.jpg?v=1704354509\" width=\"351\" height=\"184\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Two Piece Lafayette Wrought Steel Handleset",
                "description": "The Sectional Handleset with Lafayette Grip is made from wrought steel. The uniquely shaped handle gives this single cylinder or dummy function handleset an airiness that elevates it from the mundane to the stunningly beautiful. It is available with a matching lever for the interior trim or you can choose your own. Emtek's Two Piece Lafayette Wrought Steel Handleset will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-5/8 inches to 2-7/8 inches thick. Choose from satin steel and flack black steel finishes.",
